# Imodane, the Pyrohammer: "Whenever an instant or sorcery spell you control that targets only a single creature deals damage to that
# creature, Imodane deals that much damage to each opponent" (CR 120.2, 603.2). Turn 1: Lightning Bolt at Bot2's face targets no
# creature, so Imodane does nothing (Bot2 20 -> 17, refusal). Turn 3: Bolt at Bot2's Ornithopter - a 0/2, so the 3 damage is dealt in
# full though only 2 is lethal (CR 120.3) - and Imodane deals Bot2 that 3 (17 -> 14). Turn 5: Bolt at Bot1's own Ornithopter counts
# as well - "a single creature", whoever controls it - for another 3 (14 -> 11).

